","x":798,"y":1988,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크에","x":872,"y":1988,"width":144,"height":34},{"text":"실제","x":1031,"y":1988,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"설지되었기","x":1102,"y":1987,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"때문에","x":1265,"y":1987,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"나에","x":1370,"y":1989,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"게 이 프로젝트는 흥미로웠다. 몇 년이 빠르게 지나 소프트웨어 정의 네트워킹(SDN)은 주류 기","words":[{"text":"게","x":143,"y":2044,"width":22,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":180,"y":2044,"width":23,"height":33},{"text":"프로젝트는","x":218,"y":2044,"width":153,"height":33},{"text":"흥미로웠다.","x":382,"y":2043,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"몇","x":560,"y":2044,"width":27,"height":33},{"text":"년이","x":602,"y":2044,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"빠르게","x":673,"y":2043,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"지나","x":775,"y":2043,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"소프트웨어","x":844,"y":2043,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"정의","x":1004,"y":2043,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"네트워킹(SDN)은","x":1074,"y":2043,"width":241,"height":35},{"text":"주류","x":1325,"y":2045,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"기","x":1402,"y":2045,"width":26,"height":33}]},{"text":"술이 되었으며, 표준 프로토$(0penFlow와 같은)은 하부의 스위치에게 해야 할 일을 알려주기","words":[{"text":"술이","x":142,"y":2099,"width":51,"height":34},{"text":"되었으며,","x":209,"y":2098,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"표준","x":350,"y":2102,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"프로토$(0penFlow와","x":426,"y":2098,"width":311,"height":38},{"text":"같은)은","x":749,"y":2098,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"하부의","x":861,"y":2099,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"스위치에게","x":961,"y":2098,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"해야","x":1120,"y":2097,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1191,"y":2098,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"일을","x":1235,"y":2097,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"알려주기","x":1308,"y":2098,"width":121,"height":36}]},{"text":"쉽게 해주었다.","words":[{"text":"쉽게","x":143,"y":2155,"width":50,"height":33},{"text":"해주었다.","x":207,"y":2154,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"미래에는 소프트웨어 정의 네트워킹이 어떻게 발전하리라고 보는가?","words":[{"text":"미래에는","x":144,"y":2277,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"소프트웨어","x":262,"y":2278,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"정의","x":425,"y":2277,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"네트워킹이","x":497,"y":2276,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"어떻게","x":655,"y":2276,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"발전하리라고","x":753,"y":2276,"width":172,"height":33},{"text":"보는가?","x":934,"y":2277,"width":105,"height":33}]},{"text":"과기와는 달리, 네트워크 장비를 판매하는 회사뿐만 아니라 여러 프로그래머가 제어 평면 소프","words":[{"text":"과기와는","x":143,"y":2338,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"달리,","x":269,"y":2338,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크","x":352,"y":2339,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"장비를","x":489,"y":2337,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"판매하는","x":595,"y":2337,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"회사뿐만","x":730,"y":2337,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"아니라","x":859,"y":2338,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":960,"y":2338,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"프로그래머가","x":1030,"y":2339,"width":178,"height":33},{"text":"제어","x":1221,"y":2338,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"평면","x":1296,"y":2338,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"소프","x":1370,"y":2342,"width":63,"height":25}]},{"text":"트웨어를 만들 수 있다. 그러나 서버 또는 스마트 폰에서 실행되는 응용 프로그램과 달리 컨트롤","words":[{"text":"트웨어를","x":144,"y":2394,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"만들","x":267,"y":2394,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":339,"y":2394,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":383,"y":2394,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"그러나","x":464,"y":2393,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"서버","x":568,"y":2392,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":639,"y":2394,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"스마트","x":711,"y":2393,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"폰에서","x":810,"y":2393,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"실행되는","x":910,"y":2393,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"응용","x":1035,"y":2393,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램과","x":1104,"y":2394,"width":152,"height":33},{"text":"달리","x":1266,"y":2393,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"컨트롤","x":1341,"y":2393,"width":92,"height":33}]},{"text":"러 응용 프로그램은 동일한 트래픽을 처리하기 위해 함께 작동해야 한다. 즉, 네트워크 운영자는","words":[{"text":"러","x":147,"y":2449,"width":20,"height":33},{"text":"응용","x":180,"y":2449,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램은","x":248,"y":2449,"width":154,"height":33},{"text":"동일한","x":413,"y":2448,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"트래픽을","x":518,"y":2447,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"처리하기","x":653,"y":2447,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":783,"y":2448,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"함께","x":851,"y":2447,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"작동해야","x":921,"y":2447,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":1047,"y":2447,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"즉,","x":1124,"y":2450,"width":38,"height":32},{"text":"네트워크","x":1176,"y":2448,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"운영자는","x":1307,"y":2447,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"어떤 트래픽에서는 부하균형 작업을 수행하고 다른 트래픽에서는 라우팅을 수행하기를 원하지","words":[{"text":"어떤","x":146,"y":2504,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"트래픽에서는","x":211,"y":2504,"width":182,"height":34},{"text":"부하균형","x":406,"y":2504,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"작업을","x":545,"y":2504,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"수행하고","x":649,"y":2503,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":783,"y":2502,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"트래픽에서는","x":854,"y":2501,"width":174,"height":34},{"text":"라우팅을","x":1042,"y":2502,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"수행하기를","x":1171,"y":2503,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"원하지","x":1340,"y":2501,"width":89,"height":34}]},{"text":"않는다. 대신 동일한 트래픽에서 부하균형 작업과 라우팅을 함께 수행하려고 한다. 미래의 SDN","words":[{"text":"않는다.","x":146,"y":2559,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"대신","x":248,"y":2560,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"동일한","x":318,"y":2560,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"트래픽에서","x":423,"y":2558,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"부하균형","x":590,"y":2557,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"작업과","x":722,"y":2556,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"라우팅을","x":823,"y":2555,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"함께","x":947,"y":2555,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"수행하려고","x":1016,"